\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Master, speak! Thy servant heareth,
\par Waiting for Thy gracious word,
\par Longing for Thy voice that cheereth;
\par Master, let it now be heard.
\par I am listening, Lord, for Thee;
\par What hast Thou to say to me?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Speak to me by name, O Master,
\par Let me know it is to me;
\par Speak that I may follow faster,
\par With a step more firm and free,
\par Where the Shepherd leads the flock
\par In the shadow Rock.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Master, speak! Thou least and lowest,
\par Let me not unheard depart;
\par Master, speak! For O Thou knowest
\par All the yearning of my heart,
\par Knowest all its truest need;
\par Speak, and make me blest indeed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Master, speak: and make me ready,
\par When Thy voice is truely heard,
\par With obedience glad and steady
\par Still to follow every word.
\par I am listening, Lord, for Thee;
\par Master, speak! O speak to me!
\par                            Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

